    <string name="ios_onb_review1_author">Emma · Year 12, London</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review1_body">I take a photo of my lesson and Micabo gives me a clean sheet, definitions highlighted. Two hours saved every week, easily.</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review1_title">My sheets in 30 seconds</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review2_author">Noah · Grade 11, Toronto</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review2_body">The cards come back right when I was about to forget. In three weeks I went from a C to an A- in history.</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review2_title">I finally stopped rereading everything</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review3_author">Mia · Year 13, Manchester</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review3_body">You give it the date, it spreads the work. I knew what to revise every day instead of panicking the night before.</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review3_title">The plan before exams is gold</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review4_author">Zoe · Grade 10, Chicago</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review4_body">I select the passage I don\'t get and I get a clear explanation, at my level. Super helpful when I\'m stuck.</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review4_title">Mika explains when I\'m stuck</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review5_author">Liam · Year 12, Dublin</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review5_body">No dead angle: the cards go through every part of the chapter. My biology tests have no surprises anymore.</string>
    <string name="ios_onb_review5_title">The MCQs cover the whole course</string>
